WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.641
The class voted on two games. Look at the bars. Tag has six votes and chess has four.

00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:13.669
Which game received more votes? Six is greater than four, so choose the sentence about Tag.

00:00:13.669 --> 00:00:19.038
Check your answer. You used the numbers to say something about the class.
